  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Creator Link-in-Bio Email & Brand-Deal Enricher\n\nReads creator Link-in-Bio URLs (`linktr.ee`, `stan.store`, `bio.site`, `beacons.ai`, `carrd.co`, etc.) from **Google Sheets**, enriches each creator with **business/agency email, WhatsApp, normalized socials (14 platforms), affiliate/brand-deal links, discount codes, and Brand-Deal Readiness Score (0-100)**, and writes qualified outreach leads back to Google Sheets.\n\n### Setup Steps\n1. Create a Google Sheet with an `Input` tab containing a `bioUrl` column (e.g. `https://linktr.ee/halleykmcg`) and an `CreatorsOutreach` tab.\n2. Connect your **Google Sheets** OAuth credential to both Google Sheets nodes and set your spreadsheet document ID.\n3. Create an n8n **Header Auth** credential (`Name`: `Authorization`, `Value`: `Bearer <your_apify_token>`) and select it on **Enrich Creators via Apify**.\n4. Click **Test workflow**!\n\n**Actor URL:** https://apify.com/maitreya_buddha/creator-link-in-bio-email-enricher\n**Cost:** $2.50 / 1,000 enriched creators · **$0 for 404/WAF/filtered misses** · 128 MB RAM · $0 proxy.",
        "height": 380,
        "width": 460,
        "color": 3
      },
      "id": "b1a2c3d4-0004-4000-8000-000000000001",
      "name": "Sticky Note - Setup Guide",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        160,
        60
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {},
      "id": "b1a2c3d4-0004-4000-8000-000000000002",
      "name": "Manual Trigger",
